{"id":"msg_m_ex_soline_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_soline","label":"Soline · Nikke"},"label":"2. Commander,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_soline_01","next":"msg_m_ex_soline_03","speakers":{"soline":"Soline"},"icons":{"soline":"si_c071_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_1","text":"Commander,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_2","text":"I was thinking about","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_3","text":"how to use the trains","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_4","text":"more...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_5","text":"effectively?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_6","text":"What makes you think about that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_7","text":"Because I heard that a company","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_8","text":"can earn much more","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_9","text":"if it has competent employees, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_10","text":"Anyway, I have two plans.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_11","text":"Would you like to hear about them?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_12","text":"Sure, why not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_13","text":"Plan A goes like this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_14","text":"I'll dress up as an adorable train","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_15","text":"when I check the passengers' tickets at the station.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_16","text":"That way, our train station will","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_17","text":"go viral on the internet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_18","text":"People will come just to take a photo,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_19","text":"even if they're not planning on riding the train.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_20","text":"However, there will be a long line for passengers to get their tickets checked.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_21","text":"Yup!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_22","text":"Super long!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_23","text":"... Wait a minute...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_24","text":"Now I'm not so sure that's a good thing :|","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_25","text":"If the line is too long,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_26","text":"won't there be a surge in the number of complaints?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_27","text":"Most certainly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_28","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_29","text":"then Plan A won't do!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_30","text":"Anyhoo,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_31","text":"that doesn't matter,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_32","text":"cuz I have Plan B.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_33","text":"This one's gonna work for sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_34","text":"It goes like this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_35","text":"Passengers will get a coupon each time they take a train.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_36","text":"Once they collect 10 coupons,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_37","text":"they can exchange them for a bag of candies.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_38","text":"That way, they can enjoy some nice candies while taking the train.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_39","text":"So it's a win-win for everyone!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_40","text":"Who could possibly resist","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_41","text":"a plan like this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_42","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_42","text":"I'm sure there are some.","jump":"m_ex_soline_02_44"},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_43","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_43","text":"Haha, good idea!","jump":"m_ex_soline_02_53"},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_44","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_45","text":"Who?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_46","text":"Oh, right! Some people may not be happy","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_47","text":"about the flavor of candy they end up getting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_48","text":"In that case, I'll let them choose whatever flavor they want.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_49","text":"That's not the issue.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_50","text":"Bah, I don't care!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_51","text":"This is the plan, and I'm sticking to it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_52","text":"I'm gonna bring it up with Brid.","jump":"m_ex_soline_02_58"},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_53","text":"... Do you really think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_54","text":"Then how come you laughed in the beginning?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_55","text":"It makes me a little uneasy...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_56","text":"How about you discuss this with Brid first?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_57","text":"I'm gonna do just that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_58","text":"Mark my words.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_59","text":"Pretty soon, you'll be seeing candy coupons","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_60","text":"at every Ark Express station, just like I planned!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_soline_02_61","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_soline_02_61","text":"Can't wait.","jump":null}],"chat":true}